  "verbalization": "Polymatin A appears to have a complex relationship with SMMC-7721 through a series of target interactions. The evidence suggests that Polymatin A acts as a target for SK-HEP1 and Digitoxigenin, both of which in turn target SMMC-7721. This indicates a potential pathway where Polymatin A influences SK-HEP1, which then modulates Digitoxigenin, which ultimately affects SMMC-7721. The presence of multiple targets and their sequential relationships supports a mechanism where Polymatin A may indirectly influence SMMC-7721 through these intermediaries. The integration of these pathways highlights a possible regulatory or signaling role for Polymatin A in the context of SMMC-7721, though the exact nature of the interaction remains to be fully elucidated.",
